<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίλ-ησις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>compression of wool,
			felt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				849c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally,
				<i>compression, solidification</i>, esp. of
			<i>contraction</i> by cold, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				76c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Xenoph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				3.4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				58b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.8.3
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιλώσει</span>
			) ; <i>compression</i> of air, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				77.22
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάπλωσις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.385
			</span></i> : pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιλήσεις ἀέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.44U.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>overloading</i> of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>(pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
